---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Notice | Zeta" description="Review the website privacy notice for Zeta.">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-compact"><div class="shell narrow"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy Notice</h1><p>This page is a structured placeholder and must be replaced with approved privacy language before collecting live submissions.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell prose"><h2>Information collected</h2><p>Describe the specific personal information collected through recruitment and inquiry forms, why each field is necessary, and whether any optional information is requested.</p><h2>Purpose and lawful handling</h2><p>Explain how Zeta uses submissions, who can access them, how long they are retained, and the process for correction, withdrawal, or deletion where applicable.</p><h2>Sharing and service providers</h2><p>Identify relevant form, hosting, email, CRM, analytics, or storage providers and the circumstances in which data is shared.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Provide the approved privacy contact and process for questions or requests.</p><p class="verification-note">Obtain professional privacy and legal review based on the final data flow, organization, company policies, and applicable law.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
